śreyaḥ param avāpsyatha\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1043,\"bb\":932,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/11/b932/\",\"shadow_value\":\"devān – demigods; bhāvayatā – having pleased; anena – by this sacrifice; te – those; devāḥ – demigods; bhāvayantu – will please; vaḥ – you; parasparam – mutually; bhāvayantaḥ – pleasing one another; śreyaḥ – benediction; param – the supreme; avāpsyatha – you will achieve.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"devān\",\"translation\":\"demigods\"},{\"word\":\"bhāvayatā\",\"translation\":\"having pleased\"},{\"word\":\"anena\",\"translation\":\"by this sacrifice\"},{\"word\":\"te\",\"translation\":\"those\"},{\"word\":\"devāḥ\",\"translation\":\"demigods\"},{\"word\":\"bhāvayantu\",\"translation\":\"will please\"},{\"word\":\"vaḥ\",\"translation\":\"you\"},{\"word\":\"parasparam\",\"translation\":\"mutually\"},{\"word\":\"bhāvayantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"pleasing one another\"},{\"word\":\"śreyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"benediction\"},{\"word\":\"param\",\"translation\":\"the supreme\"},{\"word\":\"avāpsyatha\",\"translation\":\"you will achieve\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1044,\"bb\":933,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/11/b933/\",\"body_value\":\"The demigods, being pleased by sacrifices, will also please you, and thus, by cooperation between men and demigods, prosperity will reign for all.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1045,\"bb\":934,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/11/b934/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1046,\"bb\":935,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/11/b935/\",\"body_value\":\"Performance of yajñas has many side benefits, ultimately leading to liberation from material bondage. By performance of yajñas, all activities become purified, as it is stated in the Vedas: āhāra-śuddhau sattva-śuddhiḥ sattva-śuddhau dhruvā smṛtiḥ smṛti-lambhe sarva-granthīnāṁ vipramokṣaḥ. By performance of yajña one’s eatables become sanctified, and by eating sanctified foodstuffs one’s very existence becomes purified; by the purification of existence finer tissues in the memory become sanctified, and when memory is sanctified one can think of the path of liberation, and all these combined together lead to Kṛṣṇa consciousness, the great necessity of present-day society.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 3.11\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 3.11\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/e