yo bhuṅkte stena eva saḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1050,\"bb\":938,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/12/b938/\",\"shadow_value\":\"iṣṭān – desired; bhogān – necessities of life; hi – certainly; vaḥ – unto you; devāḥ – the demigods; dāsyante – will award; yajña-bhāvitāḥ – being satisfied by the performance of sacrifices; taiḥ – by them; dattān – things given; apradāya – without offering; ebhyaḥ – to these demigods; yaḥ – he who; bhuṅkte – enjoys; stenaḥ – thief; eva – certainly; saḥ – he.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"iṣṭān\",\"translation\":\"desired\"},{\"word\":\"bhogān\",\"translation\":\"necessities of life\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"vaḥ\",\"translation\":\"unto you\"},{\"word\":\"devāḥ\",\"translation\":\"the demigods\"},{\"word\":\"dāsyante\",\"translation\":\"will award\"},{\"word\":\"yajña-bhāvitāḥ\",\"translation\":\"being satisfied by the performance of sacrifices\"},{\"word\":\"taiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by them\"},{\"word\":\"dattān\",\"translation\":\"things given\"},{\"word\":\"apradāya\",\"translation\":\"without offering\"},{\"word\":\"ebhyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"to these demigods\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"he who\"},{\"word\":\"bhuṅkte\",\"translation\":\"enjoys\"},{\"word\":\"stenaḥ\",\"translation\":\"thief\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1051,\"bb\":939,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/12/b939/\",\"body_value\":\"In charge of the various necessities of life, the demigods, being satisfied by the performance of yajña [sacrifice], will supply all necessities to you. But he who enjoys such gifts without offering them to the demigods in return is certainly a thief.\"}]}