यज्ञा‍द्भ‍‍वति पर्जन्यो यज्ञः कर्मसमुद्भ‍वः ॥ १४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1062,\"bb\":948,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/14/b948/\",\"body_value\":\"annād bhavanti bhūtāni
parjanyād anna-sambhavaḥ
yajñād bhavati parjanyo
yajñaḥ karma-samudbhavaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1063,\"bb\":949,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/14/b949/\",\"shadow_value\":\"annāt – from grains; bhavanti – grow; bhūtāni – the material bodies; parjanyāt – from rains; anna – of food grains; sambhavaḥ – production; yajñāt – from the performance of sacrifice; bhavati – becomes possible; parjanyaḥ – rain; yajñaḥ – performance of yajña; karma – prescribed duties; samudbhavaḥ – born of.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"annāt\",\"translation\":\"from grains\"},{\"word\":\"bhavanti\",\"translation\":\"grow\"},{\"word\":\"bhūtāni\",\"translation\":\"the material bodies\"},{\"word\":\"parjanyāt\",\"translation\":\"from rains\"},{\"word\":\"anna\",\"translation\":\"of food grains\"},{\"word\":\"sambhavaḥ\",\"translation\":\"production\"},{\"word\":\"yajñāt\",\"translation\":\"from the performance of sacrifice\"},{\"word\":\"bhavati\",\"translation\":\"becomes possible\"},{\"word\":\"parjanyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"rain\"},{\"word\":\"yajñaḥ\",\"translation\":\"performance of yajña\"},{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"prescribed duties\"},{\"word\":\"samudbhavaḥ\",\"translation\":\"born of\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1064,\"bb\":950,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/14/b950/\",\"body_value\":\"All living bodies subsist on food grains, which are produced from rains. Rains are produced by performance of yajña [sacrifice], and yajña is born of prescribed duties.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1065,\"bb\":951,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/14/b951/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1066,\"bb\":952,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/14/b952/\",\"body_value\":\"Food grains or vegetables are factually eatables. The human being eats different kinds of food grains, vegetables, fruits, etc., and the animals eat the refuse of the food grains and vegetables, grass, plants, etc. Human beings who are accustomed to eating meat and flesh must also depend on the production of vegetation in order to eat the animals. Therefore, ultimately, we have to depend on the production of the field and not on the production of big factories. The field production is due to sufficient rain from the sky, and such rains are controlled by demigods like Indra, sun, moon, etc., and they are all servants of the Lord. The Lord can be satisfied by sacrifices; therefore, one who cannot perform them will find himself in scarcity – that is the law of nature. Yajña, specifically the saṅkīrtana-yajña prescribed for this age, must therefore be performed to save us at least from scarcity of food supply.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 3.14\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 3.14\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",n