तस्मात्सर्वगतं ब्रह्म नित्यं यज्ञे प्रतिष्ठितम् ॥ १५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1069,\"bb\":954,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/15/b954/\",\"body_value\":\"karma brahmodbhavaṁ viddhi
brahmākṣara-samudbhavam
